  "features.anAiCoachThat": "An AI coach that knows your data",
  "features.askForGuidanceAnd": "Ask for guidance and Fynrox matches you with one verified fitness, nutrition, yoga, or sports professional — you see exactly what they'll be able to read before you accept, then message them directly. <a href=\"/professional-guidance.html\">How guidance works</a>.",
  "features.chatWithFynroxAi": "Chat with Fynrox AI from Train, Fuel, or Recover — grounded in your real workouts, nutrition, and progress, not a generic chatbot.",
  "features.checkInDailyOn": "Check in daily on resting heart rate, sleep, HRV, soreness, and energy, and see how they trend over the last 30 days — real, self-reported signal, not a guess.",
  "features.features": "FEATURES",
  "features.followRealTrainingPrograms": "Follow real training programs backed by a full exercise library — step-by-step instructions, muscle-group and equipment filters, and smart alternatives. Every set you log (weight, reps, RPE) feeds your workout history and personal records.",
