  /* howItWorks */
  "howItWorks.aStructuredProgramNot": "A structured program, not a random workout generator. Every exercise in it is one your equipment profile says you can do; anything it can't be done with has a substitute rather than a gap.",
  "howItWorks.addAHumanIf": "Add a human, if you want one",
  "howItWorks.askTheAiCoach": "Ask the AI coach",
  "howItWorks.fynroxAiAnswersFrom": "Fynrox AI answers from your own logged data — your sets, your meals, your recovery trend. General fitness and wellness guidance only, and it says so when a question is outside that.",
  "howItWorks.fynroxIsNotA": "Fynrox is not a library of workouts you browse. It is a loop: you tell it your goal and what equipment you actually have, it builds a plan, you log what you do, and a weekly check-in adjusts the plan from what you logged. Everything else on this site is a detail of that loop.",
  "howItWorks.fynroxIsNotAMedical": "Fynrox is not a medical device and gives no medical advice. <a href=\"/safety.html\">Read the safety and privacy page</a>.",
  "howItWorks.getEarlyAccess": "Get early access",
  "howItWorks.howItWorks": "HOW IT WORKS",
  "howItWorks.ifYourHealthScreen": "If your health screen or a check-in raises something that shouldn't be trained through, Fynrox doesn't quietly carry on. Depending on what it is, you'll see a warning before the session or the plan is paused until you've spoken to a professional — and a heart condition always pauses it. That is a deliberate trade: an app that never interrupts you is an app that will eventually interrupt you far too late.",
  "howItWorks.logSetsWithWeight": "Log sets with weight, reps and RPE. Log meals and water. Check in daily on sleep, resting heart rate, HRV, soreness and energy. Each of these is a tab, not a buried screen.",
  "howItWorks.metaDescription": "How Fynrox works: a short onboarding, a plan built around your goal and your actual equipment, daily logging, and a weekly check-in that adjusts the plan. Plus an AI coach and optional human guidance.",
  "howItWorks.metaOgDescription": "One loop: plan, do, log, check in, adjust.",
  "howItWorks.metaOgTitle": "How Fynrox works — the loop",
  "howItWorks.onboarding": "Onboarding",
  "howItWorks.onceAWeekFynrox": "Once a week Fynrox asks how the week went and compares it with what you logged. That is what changes next week's plan — not a slider you have to remember to move.",
  "howItWorks.oneLoopRepeatedWeekly": "One loop, repeated weekly.",
  "howItWorks.pageTitle": "How Fynrox works — the loop",
  "howItWorks.requestProfessionalGuidanceAnd": "Request professional guidance and Fynrox matches you with a verified professional. You see exactly what they can see before anything is shared. <a href=\"/professional-guidance.html\">How guidance works</a>.",
  "howItWorks.stepByStep": "STEP BY STEP",
  "howItWorks.theLoop": "The loop",
  "howItWorks.theLoopHasA": "The loop has a brake.",
  "howItWorks.trainFuelRecover": "Train, fuel, recover",
  "howItWorks.wantInOnThe": "Want in on the pilot?",
  "howItWorks.weeklyCheckIn": "Weekly check-in",
  "howItWorks.whatActuallyHappens": "What actually happens",
  "howItWorks.whenSomethingLooksWrong": "WHEN SOMETHING LOOKS WRONG",
  "howItWorks.yourGoalYourTraining": "Your goal, your training experience, the days you can train, and — the part most apps skip — the equipment you can actually reach. A short health screen runs at the same time.",
  "howItWorks.yourPlan": "Your plan",

