  "referral.ifYouSubscribeThe": "If you subscribe, the creator who sent you here earns a commission. It doesn't change your price, your plan, or anything about your account — and they never see who signed up, what you train, what you eat, or anything about your health.",
  "referral.joinAnyway": "Join anyway",
